# Pairs with NoConcurrentLeafWrites. A gate released before the write lands lets the next writer overlap it.
MODULE: FlushKeepsWrite
TARGET: NoConcurrentLeafWrites
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the flush releases the gate without retiring its write
PERTURBS: FinishFlush

--- FIND
    /\ flush = "writing"
    /\ gate' = "free"
    /\ writes' = writes - 1
--- REPLACE
    /\ flush = "writing"
    /\ gate' = "free"
    \* MUTATION: the write is still in flight
    /\ writes' = writes
--- END
